# Go
/draiver
*.test
*.out
internal/e2e/integration/.bin/draiver

# Local data
.draiver/

# Node / Playwright (e2e)
node_modules/
/e2e/node_modules/
/e2e/package-lock.json
/e2e/test-results/
/e2e/playwright-report/
/e2e/blob-report/
/e2e/playwright/.cache/
/e2e/.bin/
/e2e/.fixture-data/
# drv-021 attempt-tabs screenshots: generated UI evidence, attached to the review
# as artefacts rather than version-controlled.
/e2e/screenshots/
# integration-rung harness builds the draiver binary here (runtime.go)
/internal/e2e/integration/.bin/

# BDD acceptance rung output (drv-019): reproducible evidence, not versioned —
# the runner regenerates cucumber.json + screenshots on every `draiver test` /
# board rerun, so a committed copy would just make the tree dirty.
/features/_artifacts/

# review env (drv-020, resolution #51): the per-instance work area up.sh builds the webui,
# dummy data root, and runtime pid/log into. Normally it lives in the ephemeral review
# worktree (removed on teardown); ignored so a local run of the scripts in the checkout
# never dirties the tree.
/.review-env-run/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.log
